        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The current president is perceived as projecting weakness internationally.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Adversaries are acting aggressively and provocatively due to perceived American weakness.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a historic moment regarding America’s commitment to its allies.",
        "confidence": 0.84
      },
      {
