        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes the audience shares their understanding of what counts as 'anti-colonial' and 'thriving'.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "It is reasonable to expect students to know foundational historical events related to major geopolitical entities.",
        "confidence": 0.87
