    "turn_text": "Well, you heard it yourself. I apologize. Normally we don't get into playing audio pieces that are 12 minutes long. But Mike Johnson, think about this. He's third in the line of secession to the presidency. That means that position, whoever's in it. Now it's Mike Johnson. is a very, very powerful person that needs to understand what the heck is",
