    "turn_text": "Can we use a scheme in this way if what they're doing is legal? He was running for president, a porn star with whom he may or may not have had an affair, comes forward to say, I'm going to the national enquirer. I'm going to tell the world that I slept with you. True or not, I'm going to tell them that. And he says in his billionaire to whom $130,000 is, yes, he's a penny pincher, they point that out in court, but he's a billionaire. It's not like 130,000 for you or me. says, get rid of her. Fine. By the way, not for nothing, but that amount, like 100 to 150, that is classic. Just make them go away money. So the number comports with just get rid of her. I don't want to deal with this. And the scheme was, I'll just do it through my pal David Packer, who runs the National Enquirer. Come here, here's 130 grand, or in the case of Karen McDougal, 150. Write your story, you know, suppose that Lee will print it, or maybe we won't, but we buy the rights to it, and then you go away. So how is this scheming?",
